1
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:07,250
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

2
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:11,860
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

3
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:16,120
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

4
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:20,330
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

5
00:00:20,670 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

6
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:24,730
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

7
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,880
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

8
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:28,760
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

9
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,650
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

10
00:00:30,930 --> 00:00:33,320
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

11
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:35,800
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

12
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:40,560
♪Come, share a cup with me♪

13
00:00:40,570 --> 00:00:42,540
(Welcome to Cold Palace Refreshments)

14
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:47,040
=Farm Busily in the Cold Palace=

15
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:48,620
(Based on Hongshu.com's Novel
I'm Busy Farming in the Cold Palace)

16
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:49,650
=Episode 10=

17
00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:53,240
Cao Zhongquan.

18
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:55,000
Bring a bridal cloth.

19
00:00:55,520 --> 00:00:56,320
Yes, Your Majesty.

20
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:58,520
You said we wouldn't do anything.

21
00:00:58,719 --> 00:00:59,799
Why do you need that?

22
00:01:01,079 --> 00:01:02,560
This isn't the Cold Palace.

23
00:01:03,119 --> 00:01:05,120
Female officials from the Palace Service
Office are outside keeping records.

24
00:01:06,840 --> 00:01:09,640
The Empress Dowager keeps sending
women to my bed.

25
00:01:10,599 --> 00:01:12,239
Let's make it convincing.

26
00:01:13,239 --> 00:01:14,680
You're unbelievable.

27
00:01:14,959 --> 00:01:16,159
First you took my money,

28
00:01:16,439 --> 00:01:17,760
now you're using me as a shield.

29
00:01:19,959 --> 00:01:22,120
Once you give up on leaving the palace,

30
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:24,239
I'll return your money.

31
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:31,159
Have you forgotten what you did
to the Lu family?

32
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:33,159
Keeping me this close...

33
00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:35,239
Aren't you afraid I'll kill you?

34
00:01:39,719 --> 00:01:40,519
Father!

35
00:01:41,480 --> 00:01:42,280
Father!

36
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:44,200
Father!

37
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:46,560
Just in time, Empress.

38
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:48,840
No need to fetch my bride, then.

39
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:51,120
Guards!

40
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:51,840
- Here!
- Here!

41
00:01:52,079 --> 00:01:53,000
Take Lady Lu

42
00:01:53,879 --> 00:01:54,959
to the Cold Palace.

43
00:01:58,599 --> 00:01:59,480
Ji Wujue!

44
00:02:01,359 --> 00:02:03,560
From heaven above to the depths below,

45
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:07,239
I'll haunt you even in death!

46
00:02:09,319 --> 00:02:10,120
Father!

47
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,159
Father!

48
00:02:14,319 --> 00:02:15,159
Father!

49
00:02:15,599 --> 00:02:17,080
Father!

50
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:32,960
What if...

51
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:37,360
What if I didn't wipe out your family,

52
00:02:38,199 --> 00:02:39,520
and there's more to this case?

53
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:41,400
would you stay?

54
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:44,439
I would.

55
00:02:44,719 --> 00:02:45,520
Yes.

56
00:02:47,360 --> 00:02:48,159
Good.

57
00:02:48,759 --> 00:02:49,599
Then I promise

58
00:02:50,639 --> 00:02:52,039
to solve this case soon

59
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:54,840
and give you and the Lu family answers.

60
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:57,199
All right.

61
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:03,960
Your Majesty.

62
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,360
The bridal cloth you requested.

63
00:03:06,159 --> 00:03:07,560
What a backward custom.

64
00:03:11,159 --> 00:03:12,439
I want to clear your name.

65
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:14,840
I want

66
00:03:16,159 --> 00:03:17,639
to have every right

67
00:03:18,639 --> 00:03:20,280
to bring you out of the Cold Palace.

68
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:25,840
(Emperors have always been fickle.)

69
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:28,280
(Could he really be in love with me?)

70
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:32,039
Close your eyes.

71
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:46,000
Are you scared?

72
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:48,319
No.

73
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:51,520
Then why pull away?

74
00:03:52,439 --> 00:03:53,439
Just now,

75
00:03:54,080 --> 00:03:55,400
I barely touched your lips.

76
00:03:56,479 --> 00:03:57,039
I...

77
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:58,199
I didn't pull away.

78
00:04:03,879 --> 00:04:05,800
You read bedtime stories, Your Majesty?

79
00:04:07,035 --> 00:04:08,663
(First Meeting at Lixia Palace)

80
00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:11,639
Isn't that my drawing?

81
00:04:11,639 --> 00:04:12,400
Yes.

82
00:04:13,319 --> 00:04:14,280
Not bad.

83
00:04:14,879 --> 00:04:16,040
I've learned a lot from it.

84
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:19,199
But

85
00:04:19,360 --> 00:04:20,720
the man in it

86
00:04:21,399 --> 00:04:22,920
is a real eyesore.

87
00:04:23,639 --> 00:04:24,920
Well, I...

88
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:26,079
I'd never seen you before.

89
00:04:26,079 --> 00:04:27,600
I mistook him for you.

90
00:04:40,279 --> 00:04:40,920
You...

91
00:04:42,959 --> 00:04:43,560
Here.

92
00:04:45,959 --> 00:04:46,920
No point wasting it.

93
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:55,680
His Majesty spent the night
with the Empress.

94
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:58,279
The Palace Service Office
will inspect the bridal cloth.

95
00:04:58,434 --> 00:04:59,874
(Lixia Palace)

96
00:05:00,199 --> 00:05:01,000
What did you say?

97
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:03,079
The Empress Dowager just sent word.

98
00:05:03,279 --> 00:05:05,439
His Majesty chose someone tonight.

99
00:05:06,279 --> 00:05:08,040
He summoned the woman from the Cold Palace
to attend him for the night.

100
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:10,000
I deserve death!

101
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:10,759
Please spare me!

102
00:05:10,759 --> 00:05:11,759
Spare me!

103
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:14,319
Please calm down, Your Highness.

104
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:15,519
Enough.

105
00:05:16,279 --> 00:05:17,079
Matron Chen.

106
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:19,759
Fetch my Shimmering Brocade.

107
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:23,199
I'll send it to Lady Lu as a gift.

108
00:05:23,319 --> 00:05:24,279
Your Highness,

109
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:26,480
Wasn't that for your
coronation as Empress...

110
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:28,240
I won't get to wear it.

111
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:30,560
Give it to the Empress

112
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:32,800
for her burial shroud.

113
00:05:34,510 --> 00:05:35,803
(Cold Palace)

114
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:42,040
One jade carving of twin lotuses,

115
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:45,040
two coral trees from the South Sea,

116
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:46,680
ten bolts of cloud brocade,

117
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:48,240
golden bird's nest...

118
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:50,399
Golden bird's nest?

119
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:53,839
Why is everything so heavy?

120
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:55,600
That cheapskate!

121
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:56,959
Not a single coin.

122
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:58,759
So afraid I'll run away.

123
00:05:58,759 --> 00:05:59,560
Hmph.

124
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:02,839
(Invitation)
What's this?

125
00:06:03,399 --> 00:06:05,319
Consort Yao sent it first thing today.

126
00:06:05,399 --> 00:06:07,240
She invited you to Lixia Palace

127
00:06:07,240 --> 00:06:08,480
to celebrate with you.

128
00:06:09,040 --> 00:06:10,399
Why didn't you tell me sooner?

129
00:06:10,839 --> 00:06:12,879
(Please Visit Lixia Palace)
She's definitely up to something.

130
00:06:12,879 --> 00:06:15,399
My lady, you mustn't go.

131
00:06:17,519 --> 00:06:19,519
A fox inviting a hen to dinner.

132
00:06:19,839 --> 00:06:20,720
Of course I'm going.

133
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:21,879
Why wouldn't I?

134
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:23,519
My lady,

135
00:06:23,519 --> 00:06:25,199
Haven't you got that backward?

136
00:06:25,439 --> 00:06:27,720
I'm a little short on cash lately.

137
00:06:28,079 --> 00:06:29,839
and someone's bringing me money.

138
00:06:34,836 --> 00:06:36,810
(Lixia Palace)

139
00:06:37,439 --> 00:06:39,720
(I couldn't see well from the roof.)

140
00:06:39,720 --> 00:06:41,199
(She's got plenty of valuables.)

141
00:06:41,639 --> 00:06:43,439
(Consort Yao is loaded.)

142
00:06:43,439 --> 00:06:44,759
Pay your respects!

143
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:49,800
Looking for another beating?

144
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:51,600
Want me to remind you?

145
00:06:51,800 --> 00:06:53,680
(I forgot how sharp-tongued she is.)

146
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:55,000
(And she hits without warning.)

147
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:58,759
I'm his wife. You're a consort.

148
00:06:59,160 --> 00:07:01,040
So who should be bowing to whom?

149
00:07:11,879 --> 00:07:14,279
Greetings, Your Majesty.

150
00:07:16,199 --> 00:07:17,519
That's better.

151
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,759
(An abandoned woman in the Cold Palace,)

152
00:07:19,879 --> 00:07:20,959
(a disgraced official's daughter,)

153
00:07:21,079 --> 00:07:22,600
(gets a little favor from His Majesty)

154
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:24,120
(and dares challenge me?)

155
00:07:24,519 --> 00:07:25,319
Well?

156
00:07:26,439 --> 00:07:27,319
What do you want?

157
00:07:29,040 --> 00:07:29,879
Matron Chen.

158
00:07:30,079 --> 00:07:31,480
Bring out the Shimmering Brocade.

159
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:32,319
Yes.

160
00:07:42,839 --> 00:07:44,240
I hear His Majesty favors you.

161
00:07:44,319 --> 00:07:45,480
This gift is for you.

162
00:07:45,519 --> 00:07:46,720
This Shimmering Brocade

163
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:49,639
was dyed with moth-wing powder
by Western Regions artisans.

164
00:07:49,959 --> 00:07:52,120
It takes 1,000 days to make one bolt.

165
00:07:52,319 --> 00:07:53,360
Best of all,

166
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:56,519
It reveals a special pattern
in moonlight.

167
00:07:57,399 --> 00:07:58,519
Moth powder?

168
00:07:59,319 --> 00:08:01,600
Wouldn't it itch like crazy?

169
00:08:02,279 --> 00:08:03,800
(Why not just give me money?)

170
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:06,720
(The Empress Dowager gave me this.)

171
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:08,240
(You have no right to it.)

172
00:08:08,399 --> 00:08:10,399
(She'll have your hide.)

173
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:12,639
(Even His Majesty won't save you.)

174
00:08:14,399 --> 00:08:16,040
(I can't just ask for money.)

175
00:08:16,279 --> 00:08:18,480
(How do I turn this rag into cash?)

176
00:08:24,279 --> 00:08:25,160
My dear sister,

177
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:27,439
don't you want to know

178
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:30,600
why His Majesty favors only me?

179
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:34,159
Are you trying to provoke me?

180
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:36,679
What makes you say that?

181
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:40,600
Of course not.

182
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:43,480
We're all sisters here.

183
00:08:43,679 --> 00:08:45,159
Naturally, I want His Majesty

184
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:46,919
to share his favor

185
00:08:47,159 --> 00:08:49,080
and have plenty of heirs.

186
00:08:50,759 --> 00:08:52,519
You're really that generous?

187
00:08:56,176 --> 00:08:57,159
(Royal Bedroom Secrets)

188
00:08:57,159 --> 00:08:57,879
This is

189
00:08:58,320 --> 00:09:00,320
His Majesty's one-of-a-kind book,
hidden under his pillow.

190
00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:01,679
It's how I won his favor.

191
00:09:02,879 --> 00:09:04,080
Just 5,000 taels,

192
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:04,759
and it's

193
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:05,600
yours.

194
00:09:06,120 --> 00:09:07,720
His Majesty reads things like this?

195
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:08,840
I don't believe you.

196
00:09:12,759 --> 00:09:13,480
Look.

197
00:09:13,639 --> 00:09:14,639
(First Meeting at Lixia Palace)
That's his handwriting, right?

198
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:16,720
It really is.

199
00:09:18,399 --> 00:09:19,639
(First Meeting at Lixia Palace)
Lixia Palace?

200
00:09:20,519 --> 00:09:23,399
Could he truly care for me?

201
00:09:23,399 --> 00:09:24,879
Of course he does.

202
00:09:25,120 --> 00:09:26,639
I'm just the budget version.

203
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:30,120
To be His Majesty's woman,
you need the whole package.

204
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:35,480
Look.

205
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:37,879
This fabric is thin but not sheer.

206
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:39,279
I can rework it

207
00:09:39,279 --> 00:09:41,000
into a fitted summer dress.

208
00:09:41,279 --> 00:09:42,840
Just add another 5,000 taels.

209
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,840
What outfit costs 5,000 taels?

210
00:09:46,399 --> 00:09:48,960
One night of passion is worth a fortune.

211
00:09:49,159 --> 00:09:51,399
It's bedroom fun. You get it?

212
00:09:55,399 --> 00:09:58,279
Would His Majesty really like this?

213
00:09:58,279 --> 00:10:00,000
Would I lie to you?

214
00:10:00,279 --> 00:10:01,639
Twice the effect, half the effort.

215
00:10:03,759 --> 00:10:04,759
Go.

216
00:10:04,759 --> 00:10:06,000
Open my private treasury.

217
00:10:06,159 --> 00:10:06,879
Your Highness!

218
00:10:07,399 --> 00:10:08,039
Yao,

219
00:10:08,279 --> 00:10:08,879
look.

220
00:10:09,320 --> 00:10:10,759
Just enough to tease.

221
00:10:11,120 --> 00:10:12,960
His Majesty will adore you.

222
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:19,200
Hesitate, and I'll sell to Consort Lan.

223
00:10:19,519 --> 00:10:20,559
Don't regret it later.

224
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:21,879
Quickly!

225
00:10:21,879 --> 00:10:23,559
Go get 10,000 taels for her.

226
00:10:55,279 --> 00:10:57,120
You really are something.

227
00:10:57,399 --> 00:10:59,679
If this wins His Majesty's favor,

228
00:10:59,759 --> 00:11:00,639
I shall

229
00:11:00,639 --> 00:11:02,279
I'll repay you for the rest of my life.

230
00:11:05,880 --> 00:11:06,874
(Yun Banknote)
10,000 taels

231
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:09,039
Think nothing of it.

232
00:11:09,159 --> 00:11:10,360
Then I'll

233
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:11,639
be on my way.

234
00:11:11,879 --> 00:11:12,960
Matron Chen, see her out.

235
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:13,559
No need.

236
00:11:15,039 --> 00:11:16,600
My work here is done.

237
00:11:17,279 --> 00:11:18,879
No need for fame or glory.

238
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:20,200
Bye!

239
00:11:24,159 --> 00:11:24,960
Your Highness,

240
00:11:25,279 --> 00:11:27,240
will you really befriend Lady Lu?

241
00:11:27,279 --> 00:11:28,279
And the Empress Dowager?

242
00:11:29,519 --> 00:11:31,200
I was just saying that.

243
00:11:31,799 --> 00:11:34,240
In this harem, it's all self-interest.

244
00:11:34,919 --> 00:11:36,200
There's no real friendship.

245
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:39,600
Your Majesty.

246
00:11:40,039 --> 00:11:42,200
The Empress went to Lixia Palace.

247
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:45,200
Consort Yao invited her?

248
00:11:45,679 --> 00:11:46,480
Yes, Your Majesty.

249
00:11:47,159 --> 00:11:48,200
Consort Yao

250
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:50,240
isn't easy to deal with.

251
00:11:50,559 --> 00:11:53,000
Her attendants are no pushovers either.

252
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:55,759
Do you want to go check on her?

253
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:58,240
Hmph.

254
00:11:59,480 --> 00:12:01,320
Since when are you on Lu Yunluo's side?

255
00:12:03,759 --> 00:12:05,720
I would never, Your Majesty!

256
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:06,840
It's just...

257
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:07,960
It's just that, in this palace,

258
00:12:07,960 --> 00:12:11,279
only the Empress can make you smile.

259
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:16,519
She certainly is different.

260
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:18,600
Others fight for favor,

261
00:12:18,879 --> 00:12:20,120
while she grows crops,

262
00:12:20,120 --> 00:12:21,039
studies the stars,

263
00:12:21,440 --> 00:12:22,559
and runs businesses.

264
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:24,879
She's full of tricks.

265
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:27,720
How could Consort Yao beat her?

266
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:32,039
I worried for nothing.

267
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:33,799
But you did remind me.

268
00:12:34,080 --> 00:12:36,080
If I intend to restore her as Empress,

269
00:12:36,360 --> 00:12:37,960
she does need more attendants.

270
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:41,679
You've already assigned her
your best guards.

271
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:44,639
Jia and Yi are men, after all.

272
00:12:45,039 --> 00:12:46,519
They can't tend to her personal needs.

273
00:12:47,679 --> 00:12:48,879
Go to the chancellor's estate.

274
00:12:49,159 --> 00:12:50,360
See if any trusted servants remain.

275
00:12:50,399 --> 00:12:51,279
If so,

276
00:12:51,440 --> 00:12:52,919
send them to serve her
in the Cold Palace.

277
00:12:53,279 --> 00:12:54,799
As you command.

278
00:13:28,763 --> 00:13:32,793
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

279
00:13:33,183 --> 00:13:37,403
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

280
00:13:37,443 --> 00:13:41,623
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

281
00:13:41,683 --> 00:13:45,873
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

282
00:13:46,213 --> 00:13:50,273
♪Cool dew, starry nights,
wheat sprouts in my hands♪

283
00:13:50,343 --> 00:13:54,523
♪I shape fields, not painted brows,
and fill them with hope♪

284
00:13:54,963 --> 00:13:58,333
♪Gold and silver bloom from the soil♪

285
00:13:58,803 --> 00:14:03,483
♪I smile as the world storms on♪

286
00:14:05,143 --> 00:14:07,293
♪No finery to rival spring♪

287
00:14:07,473 --> 00:14:11,773
♪All I wish for are waves of green♪

288
00:14:14,183 --> 00:14:15,933
♪Where is beauty found?♪

289
00:14:16,113 --> 00:14:20,543
♪Just lift your eyes and see♪

290
00:14:21,103 --> 00:14:22,673
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

291
00:14:22,693 --> 00:14:25,163
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

292
00:14:25,233 --> 00:14:27,313
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

293
00:14:27,473 --> 00:14:29,243
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

294
00:14:29,853 --> 00:14:31,123
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

295
00:14:31,353 --> 00:14:33,753
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

296
00:14:33,993 --> 00:14:36,293
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

297
00:14:36,573 --> 00:14:40,893
♪Come, share a cup with me♪
